  "body": "[Matrix discussion](https://matrix.to/#/!SGNQGPGUwtcPBUotTL:matrix.org/$unvQYxlDFnAg9KDzDYIR21sGzqt8K0rqhQ8RufcpgXs?via=jki.re&via=matrix.org&via=element.io) (internal)\r\n\r\nCurrently, the push condition for the default rule `.m.rule.is_user_mention` looks like this in a (sliding) sync response:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n    \"kind\": \"event_property_contains\",\r\n    \"key\": \"content.m\\\\.mentions.user_ids\",\r\n    \"value_type\": \"user_id\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat last property should be `\"value\": <actual user ID>` instead.",
